<h1 local-id=3D"5798394f708f" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-Disclaimer">Disc=
laimer</h1>
<p local-id=3D"fa4237964726">These standards apply to production-grade syst=
ems. Exploratory code may follow relaxed rules. Any changes made to this do=
cument will be communicated directly by email.<br></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"3d116602f4e1" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.ProjectStructu=
re">1. Project Structure</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"f9dd8a41a97c" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.1Codebase">1.1=
 Codebase</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"6acaa5088f44" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.1.1AzureDevOps=
">1.1.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Azure DevOps</h3>
<p local-id=3D"1872c77071bb">Any code that has been written for development=
 or production environments should exist inside the correct Azure DevOps or=
ganisation:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7bdeeae0f6dc">
<li local-id=3D"4ab172c0bc43">
<p local-id=3D"8afa3316820d">OstricaPortman for portfolio management relate=
d code, such as models</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca5792bf3f58">
<p local-id=3D"580684a8460a">OstricaDevOps for infrastructure and tools</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"97bbf8284a2f" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.1.2Project">1.=
1.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Project</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2e3c71fccc8a">Each project will have its own project inside =
the organization of choice. A project should only have the tools it needs, =
such as a repository and pipelines. A description of the project must be pr=
ovided, including the owner of the project.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"cf4cf5a160d5" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.1.3Repository"=
>1.1.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Repository</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f3fd5947ba53">A project can consist of multiple =E2=80=98sub=
projects=E2=80=99. Each subproject should have its own repository, followin=
g the rules below. Larger applications, such as full tools, would have a re=
pository for the backend, one for the frontend and another for deployments.=
</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"b882e5497402" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.2Folderstructu=
re">1.2 Folder structure</h2>
<p local-id=3D"1f02e676aef4">The base structure for a project should be con=
sistent across all repositories:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"501e14d0df67">
<li local-id=3D"8bcb9d865eea">
<p local-id=3D"b946597907e9">api/ (optional)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb44a27dc6eb">
<p local-id=3D"0ceca58e6fd7">app/</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5b589428930">
<p local-id=3D"f457c1b8774b">core/</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7bcbc55cf773">
<p local-id=3D"3beca03b56a5">tests/</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"72a2d2929409" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.2.1Api(optiona=
l)">1.2.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Api (optional)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f1b5f8851143">Containing API endpoints. Only applicable for =
API servers. Subfolder structure should mimic endpoint pathing:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"03714e754df3">
<li local-id=3D"af9e02617b9a">
<p local-id=3D"aea52170d151">API -&gt; V1 -&gt; subject_1<br>
 https://url.com/api/v1/subject_1/ ...</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1ba57c42e752">
<p local-id=3D"facd0eba1f37">API -&gt; V1 -&gt; subject_2<br>
 https://url.com/api/v1/subject_2/ ...</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"fa788876d3ca" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.2.2App">1.2.2&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; App &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp=
;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3>
<p local-id=3D"090a81fdef94">Domain specific logic.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f21577d3a56a"><strong>Rules:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c2e951c3d168">
<li local-id=3D"21fe48c553c0">
<p local-id=3D"fb94e11b328b">Business logic</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f61f2ca8b878">
<p local-id=3D"7a39dc8cc4a0">No generic helper functions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"82ea3ffa07bc">
<p local-id=3D"ddadcb029241">No logic that is required for the server/scrip=
ts to function properly at an application level</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4a073c5f1c86"><strong>Structure (CSR based):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"51c54ad36bc1">
<li local-id=3D"dc179db45e9c">
<p local-id=3D"f0c30925e5ef">App</p>
<ul local-id=3D"df91d8a1ac1b">
<li local-id=3D"7686ba65575c">
<p local-id=3D"885c313239f1">Controllers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35711fd933f9">
<p local-id=3D"0bd46a4c5a91">Services</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bfa67c36c5b1">
<p local-id=3D"2692260f53e9">Repositories</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0acac1f9d834">
<p local-id=3D"c7f5aa015e92">Factories</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"51faf0afa68a">
<p local-id=3D"19ebd5d173a3">Models</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"966a31d5b93f">=E2=80=A6</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"b276f32ad94d" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.2.3Core">1.2.3=
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Core&nbsp;</h3>
<p local-id=3D"49525331c03a">Contains shared and cross-cutting logic:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6f1c6049b95c">
<li local-id=3D"53a58b185e3d">
<p local-id=3D"420ad104c080">Configuration</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a6e58dc42b13">
<p local-id=3D"4cd059ad86d7">Logging</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3af45c7feb38">
<p local-id=3D"7789ad67c891">Helper functions (domain agnostic)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d169110d3d23">
<p local-id=3D"0e027e1ec9af">Enums</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"425e217e0ab3">
<p local-id=3D"80661412eac3">Custom exceptions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e328f7c78f4f">
<p local-id=3D"8c3da32a8d96">Server logic</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f90a288c4ef4">
<p local-id=3D"a93ec835a900">Ideally code that is reusable across projects<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"d1dbfc6ff6c7" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.2.4Tests">1.2.=
4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tests</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ad711d085e97">Mirrors the main application structure:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d17a1181b556">
<li local-id=3D"8746ade80165">
<p local-id=3D"7c3aa212d579">Tests</p>
<ul local-id=3D"cc2aa6a53994">
<li local-id=3D"4937cfc2b59d">
<p local-id=3D"f5b5480451dc">Controllers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fd90e2c31b3f">
<p local-id=3D"72535942d04c">Services</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"733dfe58aed1">
<p local-id=3D"0b10e763178c">Repositories</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4f8e4b1d16cf">=E2=80=A6</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"be21436c8ea3" id=3D"OstricaCodingStandards-1.3Rootfiles">1.=
3&nbsp;&nbsp;Root files</h2>
<p local-id=3D"5f8da61f59fe">Applications require a few files to function p=
roperly in a development and production environment</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"69=
86eb6f-7b5d-4d88-9efc-5232615203d4" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f25c2e29-350b-4b17-8571-75093d98857a">
